# UBSan suppressions for the two DELIBERATE UB patterns that survive
# phase 1 (both scheduled to disappear with the phase-3 native-pointer
# memory model — see the Portable Roadmap):
#
# - bnkf.c promotes bank-file offsets to pointers via u32 wraparound
#   arithmetic (offsets rebased in place, the core 32-bit-blob strategy).
# - chrprop.c reads prop->rooms[4..6] past the u8[4] array ON PURPOSE —
#   Rare lets the room list spill into the following field (engine
#   semantics; scans are capped at 7 since the M3 fix).
#
# Usage:
#   UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=port/tests/ubsan.supp ./ge007-port ...
pointer-overflow:bnkf.c
bounds:chrprop.c
